cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "HybridInfer (Android AAR): reliability-aware LLM router library"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Simran
    family-names: Koul
repository-code: "https://github.com/SimranKoul2026/HybridInfer-AAR-library"
abstract: >-
  The HybridInfer reliability router as an Android library: runs each LLM
  request on an on-device model first and automatically falls back to a remote
  model when on-device inference stalls, crashes, or is predicted to fail. The
  Kotlin twin of the Python tool, verified against the same conformance vectors.
keywords:
  - llm
  - on-device
  - android
  - routing
  - reliability
  - fallback
  - mlc-llm
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-31"
